	(text "24 V -> 5.02 V (100k/24.9k): VCC1 of the four NSI6651 and the AHCT input stage - the driver\ninput thresholds are specified at VCC1 = 5 V only (p7). Load <= 39 mA (datasheet maxima)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 202.916 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
