	)
	(text "OUT is open drain on the RDY line: RDY low below 19.66-20.40 V, released above 20.12-20.60 V. That is above\nthe UCC14241-Q1 UVLO (17.1-18.9 V falling): EN_DRV drops and every driver pulls its gates to VEE\nwhile the bias is still regulating -> clean turn-off when the safety chain removes +24V_GD (D-012)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 206.076 181.252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b2b5f56d-0986-5d4b-a515-f2b66090011d")
	)
	(text "24 V -> 3.315 V (100k/43.2k, SNVSB49D 10.2, as PV-PORT). Runs down to 4.2 V input, so the logic keeps\nevery gate disabled while +24V collapses. Load <= 119 mA (datasheet maxima)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125.656 82.004 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fee4b76f-7fcc-516b-be7b-a8388fb2a7ea")
	)
